<h2>When the fee is and is not worth paying</h2>
<p>A fee only makes sense if the claim grows by more than the fee. On a small claim with a fair first offer, it will not, and you should handle the claim yourself. We walk through that decision in <a href="/post/should-i-use-a-public-adjuster/">should I use a public adjuster</a>. If you are still not sure what a public adjuster does for the money, see <a href="/post/what-is-a-public-adjuster-a-complete-guide-for-property-owners/">what is a public adjuster</a>.</p>
